                        ],
                        "form": "den Beichtstuhl"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "cdfa6264-9b3c-479c-b8d7-765c7f042c0d",
                        "entry_id": "2883277e-8dc9-320e-a0c6-69a1072c890f",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Beichtstühle"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b34daea4-3fb4-37b8-817f-5f7e0598b6d1",
                        "entry_id": "2883277e-8dc9-320e-a0c6-69a1072c890f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ein geschlossenes, schrankartiges, hölzernes, oft mit kunstvollem Schnitzwerk verziertes Möbelstück in katholischen Kirchen, das in zwei oder (meist) drei Innenräume geteilt ist: einen für den Priester, einen (bzw. zwei) für die Beichtenden (zwei zur alternierenden - nicht gleichzeitigen - Benutzung)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5480f539-4900-485e-8d39-9ecd8f82aa30",
                                "sense_id": "b34daea4-3fb4-37b8-817f-5f7e0598b6d1",
                                "text": "\"Weiter hinten, wo das Schiff sich verengt, steht dem Beichtstuhl gegenüber eine Statuette der Madonna; …\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c3298fe-3b5f-4b5e-b1e6-17646d50c482",
                                "sense_id": "b34daea4-3fb4-37b8-817f-5f7e0598b6d1",
                                "text": "Im sogenannten Beichtzimmer, einer Weiterentwicklung des Beichtstuhls, kann der Beichtende sowohl sitzend ein offenes Gespräch führen, aber auch traditionell kniend durch eine Trennscheibe hindurch mit dem Priester kommunizieren."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bc51a00-1a06-450a-b732-71cb5c9dfcc9",
                                "sense_id": "b34daea4-3fb4-37b8-817f-5f7e0598b6d1",
                                "text": "„Die Katholiken hatten Bänke zum Niederknien und Beichtstühle in der Kirche.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4365f6d7-4c58-4b7c-a01a-d54d240f9388",
                                "sense_id": "b34daea4-3fb4-37b8-817f-5f7e0598b6d1",
                                "text": "„Auf der Suche nach einem Fluchtweg öffnete er die Seitentüre zur Sakristei und versteckte sich in einem Beichtstuhl.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d4663a2-e472-49ae-a2c7-06466087fe48",
                                "sense_id": "b34daea4-3fb4-37b8-817f-5f7e0598b6d1",
                                "text": "„Er mußte die Sache im Beichtstuhl von der gleichen Person gehört haben, die der Hexe das Blut gebracht hatte.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14e771e9-6b48-4e17-ac22-6425544f72e5",
                        "source_entry_id": "2883277e-8dc9-320e-a0c6-69a1072c890f",
                        "source_sense_id": "b34daea4-3fb4-37b8-817f-5f7e0598b6d1",
                        "source_sense_description": "Möbelstück in katholischen Kirchen, in dem ein Priester die Beichte anhört",
                        "target_lang_word": "confessional",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "confessional",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29ea62ef-51a3-360a-8b08-1f44413448a4",
                                        "entry_id": "bfe67e81-436b-3f7b-9a7b-76b7ea68d56f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In the manner or style of a confession."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4849bd1-e80e-4134-9d52-f4e1d5e33157",
                                                "sense_id": "29ea62ef-51a3-360a-8b08-1f44413448a4",
                                                "text": "The studied reticence of the poems in quatrains is opposed to the more confessional aspects of the monologue."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "245df202-c051-398a-b60a-afca47ff0c26",
                                        "entry_id": "bfe67e81-436b-3f7b-9a7b-76b7ea68d56f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Officially practicing a particular shared religion, as a state or organization; see confessionalism 1."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2a4bfc7-b0be-47bf-b718-a26e6ad7715f",
                                                "sense_id": "245df202-c051-398a-b60a-afca47ff0c26",
                                                "text": "confessional community"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "confessional",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eac269e4-1ffa-3e6e-a1d6-1a6a6b68cf23",
                                        "entry_id": "eb526d01-6195-3fbb-97d9-ad0a8001365d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small room where confession—the Sacrament of Penance—is performed in private with a priest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "713a412c-8ce7-4e6e-8fcc-8bf96b82e822",
                                                "sense_id": "eac269e4-1ffa-3e6e-a1d6-1a6a6b68cf23",
                                                "text": "The confessional's chief amusement has been seduction–in all the ages of the Church."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b7d79d2-0ae3-4ecd-9fc0-98f3a2358ef6",
                                                "sense_id": "eac269e4-1ffa-3e6e-a1d6-1a6a6b68cf23",
                                                "text": "In one of the aisles there was an elaborately carved confessional box and I recognised the village priest in his heavy mountain boots and black cassock as he entered it and drew the dark velvet curtains behind him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68248a83-b2f8-3cf0-8bc5-4785b3b34519",
                                        "entry_id": "eb526d01-6195-3fbb-97d9-ad0a8001365d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A confession."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1d4888f-2c4c-42c4-86da-50c49eb842db",
                                                "sense_id": "68248a83-b2f8-3cf0-8bc5-4785b3b34519",
                                                "text": "When a 35-year-old Bill Clinton, famously the nation’s youngest former governor, set out in 1982 to reclaim the job he had lost two years earlier, he began with a remarkable televised confessional.\n“My daddy never had to whip me twice for the same thing,” Mr. Clinton told Arkansans in a campaign commercial, acknowledging voters’ anger over his having raised a hated vehicle fee and vowing to listen better if they gave him another chance as governor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d2c5fa37-da55-3ccf-b201-62a3bca5deaa",
                                        "entry_id": "eb526d01-6195-3fbb-97d9-ad0a8001365d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A filmed interview in which a cast member speaks directly into the camera commenting on the events of the episode."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2ffe8f2-f896-4d0a-b004-2e49544e8ea0",
                                                "sense_id": "d2c5fa37-da55-3ccf-b201-62a3bca5deaa",
                                                "text": "We see Brooks seethe in a corner, and, in a cut to a confessional, he exaggerates the scene, saying, “I’m feeling really uncomfortable. Her vagina’s in my face.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14e59c3e-786d-43eb-8bd9-82752e3670a5",
                                                "sense_id": "d2c5fa37-da55-3ccf-b201-62a3bca5deaa",
                                                "text": "These characters behave as crassly as they do in large part because producers of shows such as The Bachelor deprive them of all contact with the outside world ([…]) and ply them with alcohol, then goad them to unleash their petty grievances in filmed \"confessionals\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
